\coordinate (B2) at (8.88,0);
\coordinate (C2) at (5.726,2.190);
\draw (A2) -- (B2) node[midway,below] {$kc$};
\draw (A2) -- (C2) node[midway,above left] {$ka$};
\draw (B2) -- (C2) node[midway,above right] {$kb$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

**SAS**: two pairs of corresponding sides in the same ratio, and the included angle between them equal.

[tikz]
